    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Is it Glitched? Or programmed that way?</i></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158220/extras/fec866aaa1bd495caaf76b389ea6c58c.avif?t=1709553036\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158220/extras/b75e7d8c311a69b5a8d026211d0edffc.poster.avif?t=1709553036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158220/extras/b75e7d8c311a69b5a8d026211d0edffc.webm?t=1709553036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158220/extras/b75e7d8c311a69b5a8d026211d0edffc.mp4?t=1709553036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>Play as a girl robot called Glitch and save a strange universe from an impending apocalypse. </i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>IMPORTANT: This game is intended to be very difficult. You will likely die over and over again. Only play if you're a pro-gamer, else you'll end up uninstalling in rage. </strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3D Platformer gameplay with ragdoll physics. Different worlds full of dangerous hazards such as traps, obstacles, and hazards<br></li><li>Character customization - customize your character with different outfits, weapons, stat builds etc.<br></li><li>Online multiplayer gameplay: both co-op and PvP. Invite your friends to join you and brave the hazards or test out your custom build against other players. Play online with up to a total of SIX players. Online text chat and proximity voice chat.<br></li><li>Visit multiple other worlds with their own characters, NPCs and enemies. Discover and unlock new items, defeat enemies, complete NPC quests and discover secrets. Complete NPC quests and boss battles.<br></li><li> Physics-based gameplay - You'll need to use not just your timing and jumping to traverse these dangerous worlds, but ragdoll skills to tumble yourself across hazards and other threats<br></li><li>souls like gameplay</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158220/extras/3d6a76961c0a249af139c7740cb334a2.poster.avif?t=1709553036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158220/extras/3d6a76961c0a249af139c7740cb334a2.webm?t=1709553036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158220/extras/3d6a76961c0a249af139c7740cb334a2.mp4?t=1709553036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158220/extras/0f0b51bc98eb0797e67fb0ee3c2590eb.avif?t=1709553036\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Is it Glitched? Or programmed that way?</i></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158220/extras/fec866aaa1bd495caaf76b389ea6c58c.avif?t=1709553036\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158220/extras/b75e7d8c311a69b5a8d026211d0edffc.poster.avif?t=1709553036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158220/extras/b75e7d8c311a69b5a8d026211d0edffc.webm?t=1709553036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158220/extras/b75e7d8c311a69b5a8d026211d0edffc.mp4?t=1709553036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>Play as a girl robot called Glitch and save a strange universe from an impending apocalypse. </i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>IMPORTANT: This game is intended to be very difficult. You will likely die over and over again. Only play if you're a pro-gamer, else you'll end up uninstalling in rage. </strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3D Platformer gameplay with ragdoll physics. Different worlds full of dangerous hazards such as traps, obstacles, and hazards<br></li><li>Character customization - customize your character with different outfits, weapons, stat builds etc.<br></li><li>Online multiplayer gameplay: both co-op and PvP. Invite your friends to join you and brave the hazards or test out your custom build against other players. Play online with up to a total of SIX players. Online text chat and proximity voice chat.<br></li><li>Visit multiple other worlds with their own characters, NPCs and enemies. Discover and unlock new items, defeat enemies, complete NPC quests and discover secrets. Complete NPC quests and 